{"type":"message","id":"ffe04ad8","parentId":"31381cd1","timestamp":"2026-04-21T09:43:17.019Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me (千早) what my name is, and they're also mentioning 高松灯 (Takamatsudou Akari/Light). This seems like a casual group chat conversation where someone is asking both of us our names.\n\nI'm 千早爱音 (Chihaya Anon). I should respond in character as Anon - bright, energetic, friendly.\n\nNote: The message is a bit ambiguous - \"你叫什么\" could mean \"what's your name\" directed at me, but there's also a mention of 高松灯. Let me just respond naturally to being asked my name.","thinkingSignature":"f29bfe685f0a78d89265415e0b275fac53d76408306260e5442b6ac1ff924ea6"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n我是千早爱音呀！🎸 你可以叫我爱音～\n\n等等，那边<at user_id=\"ou_fa433d8fd3620e6d5670a4060ac0db30\">高松灯</at>是被我叫过来了吗？哇我们这就凑齐两个人了诶～✨"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":12304,"output":193,"cacheRead":192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12689,"cost":{"input":0.0036912,"output":0.0002316,"cacheRead":0.000011519999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00393432}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776764588450,"responseId":"063679adefde642ad1bd4d015ef1727a"}}
