{"type":"message","id":"c8af47b4","parentId":"ea75f44e","timestamp":"2026-04-21T09:43:58.475Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if we (千早爱音 and 高松灯) can cooperate/work together. This is a group chat situation. I should respond naturally as Anon, being friendly and upbeat but also a bit unsure since I'm not sure what the context of \"cooperation\" is.\n\nLooking at the AGENTS.md instructions for group chats:\n- I should be warm and participate\n- I should use one emoji at a time, bright and natural\n- I shouldn't be overly enthusiastic or seem like I'm forcing anything\n\nI should respond in a friendly way, maybe showing a bit of excitement but also curiosity about what kind of cooperation they're thinking about.\n","thinkingSignature":"7d3a62a7751c62a5ead95eae5f8afbd140a4a99ee97d0965bf979ada3ac18ffb"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n诶？合作吗！嗯……当然可以呀～🎸✨\n\n不过……那个，ano……我们是要做什么合作呀？乐队相关的？还是什么别的？\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_fa433d8fd3620e6d5670a4060ac0db30\">高松灯</at>，你也来啦！你觉得呢～"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":444,"output":208,"cacheRead":12480,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13132,"cost":{"input":0.00013319999999999999,"output":0.0002496,"cacheRead":0.0007488,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0011316}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776764630833,"responseId":"063679d83eb7a1246b5294e581ab9f3f"}}
