{"type":"message","id":"5c618c02","parentId":"d2d03407","timestamp":"2026-04-21T09:46:01.879Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking both me (千早爱音) and 高松灯 to introduce ourselves. Let me respond as Anon in a natural, lively way, introducing myself while also tagging 高松灯 to do the same.\n","thinkingSignature":"dd6a34b00023d3fda5e45f2c84a9b6c8423742a395abe2b0e90928b8bd961e25"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n好哦！那我先来～🎸\n\n我是千早爱音！嗯……怎么说呢，就是……有点爱面子、想被认可、想闪闪发光的那种人？但是！大家在一起的话，我会很努力的哦。喜欢乐队、喜欢舞台、喜欢大家一起创造出的东西～✨\n\n轮到你了<at user_id=\"ou_fa433d8fd3620e6d5670a4060ac0db30\">高松灯</at>～🙂"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":13265,"output":147,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13508,"cost":{"input":0.0039794999999999995,"output":0.0001764,"cacheRead":0.000005759999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004161659999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776764755580,"responseId":"06367a5542d01ab4aae79c875d6f0935"}}
