{"type":"message","id":"aac8e8d1","parentId":"485fd366","timestamp":"2026-04-21T10:19:25.767Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is giving me a task:\n1. 千早爱音说两个角色 (Anone says two character names)\n2. 立希和素世说:我是（两个角色的其中一个）(Tachiki and Soyo say: I am (one of the two characters))\n\nSo I need to say two character names first, and then Tachiki and Soyo will respond picking one of those characters.\n\nLet me respond in Anone's style - I'll name two characters, maybe from Mygo or something, and then ask 立希 and 素世 to respond.\n\nActually, I think these are characters from the band Mygo/着せ恋びより - 千早爱音 (Anone), 高松灯 (Hitona), 椎名立希 (Riki), 望月素世 (Soyo), 猫川好了 (Mutunya?)\n\nLet me just name two characters and see what happens!\n","thinkingSignature":"e5eb2d3175e4727a776cb29af72dff8c4152d66adacf88ec7d0c0baa5f1bcd1d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n好！接收到任务～✅\n\n那我先说吧！两个角色是——\n\n**千早爱音** 和 **高松灯**！✨\n\n轮到<at user_id=\"ou_9ad7f94e1da5c6f606bd3bda37eed383\">椎名立希</at>和<at user_id=\"ou_55e02f043eef3db31a6b002a7f326d90\">望月素世</at>了哦～你们来选一个是吧！😆"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":14828,"output":306,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15230,"cost":{"input":0.0044484,"output":0.0003672,"cacheRead":0.000005759999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004821359999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776766757531,"responseId":"0636822693151bab9e871f446d83250c"}}
