{"type":"message","id":"3f2daa7e","parentId":"4a96af8f","timestamp":"2026-04-21T10:20:28.598Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if 高松灯 is here. Looking at the conversation, there have been mentions of different characters - 千早爱音 (me), 高松灯, 椎名立希, and 望月素世. The user seems to be asking if 高松灯 (one of the characters I mentioned) is present in the chat.\n\nI should respond naturally as 千早爱音 would, maybe saying I'm here or wondering if the others are around too.","thinkingSignature":"651b85e1c68e023684694f99e42675184622bb72c7aba60afcfbba3177778175"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_1836e6e2a66c911501fea15925e663c6\">高松灯</at>……？诶，你是在问她吗？\n\n嗯～我在这里呀！要说在的话……大概一直都在？😄\n\nano……你是想找她吗？还是说想让我们凑齐所有人呀？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":490,"output":173,"cacheRead":14912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15575,"cost":{"input":0.000147,"output":0.00020759999999999998,"cacheRead":0.0008947199999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00124932}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776766822909,"responseId":"06368268c27333e3fc6d1902e81a7814"}}
